{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"勝った……ということは……","trans":"赢了……也就是说……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800620010","name":"円香","text":"……ちょっとした退屈しのぎのつもりでしたが\r\nわりと楽しかったです","trans":"……本来只是想随便打发一下无聊\n不过还挺开心的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"円香……\r\n俺も楽しかったよ","trans":"圆香……\n我也很开心哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800620030","name":"円香","text":"……一度しか言いませんから","trans":"……我只说一次","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800620040","name":"円香","text":"──あなたが好き","trans":"——我喜欢你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……！！\r\nまど────","trans":"……！！\n圆────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800620050","name":"円香","text":"はい、おしまい\r\nこれで充分ですよね","trans":"好，结束了\n这样就够了吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──！？！？　夢──……？","trans":"——！？！？　是梦——……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（────……やっぱり、\r\nここは正統派に、『告白』でいくのがいいかな……！）","trans":"（————……果然，\n这里还是走正统路线，选“告白”比较好吧……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}